sequenceDiagram
  participant A as Ingress Node A
  participant B as Worker 1 Node B
  participant C as Journal Node C
  participant Sup as Supervisor Node B
  participant B2 as Worker 2 Node B
  A->>B: command 42 (captured send/receive)
  B->>C: journal read/write (only if captured)
  B->>B: external write attempted
  Note right of B: External effect outcome unknown
  B--xSup: abnormal exit (observed)
  Sup->>B2: start replacement worker (observed)
  B2->>C: recover command (if captured)
  B2->>B2: second external write attempted
  Note over B,B2: Same logical role, different process incarnations
